{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國傳奇女星芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）原定出席第79屆康城影展閉幕典禮，接受象徵終身成就獎的榮譽金棕櫚獎，但因膝蓋受傷，目前仍在休養</p><p>史翠珊5月18日透過聲明表示：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200616/349520046361546752.jpeg/jIgPwMD8zHuNSFWhSZ3MX54TYKOawxgDUfWCelH1gno\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（IG@barbrastreisand）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（IG@barbrastreisand）</figcaption></figure><p>更多芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand的相片：</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260316/1110162746822889472283017.jpeg/b2ivTbU5zwT841o7sj36hhxV-fM61A-Va703eWu9N3k\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand與羅拔烈福Robert Redford（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand與羅拔烈福Robert Redford（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260316/1110162749285076992140563.jpeg/Bpz-fCaysTrqcx4cLVcsf8t8OpGmHWgGDX6sSA1-rEg\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand與羅拔烈福Robert Redford（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand與羅拔烈福Robert Redford（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260316/1110162751755653120503871.jpeg/n_jHEgfQ7Lx5W2PI5WaTPJCPdnyoho7ZdS46unUuOro\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand與羅拔烈福Robert Redford（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand與羅拔烈福Robert Redford（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260316/1110162754255589376165829.jpeg/jSp0kxsGtne8IWtffOS6e26RgFra5Tuhjrppwo66acI\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand與羅拔烈福Robert Redford（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand與羅拔烈福Robert Redford（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260316/1110162756696805376196802.jpeg/Thk6CSp91HfBtQy_IoiKcc1hOfG35Q2SQLrB40C6weM\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand與羅拔烈福Robert Redford（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand與羅拔烈福Robert Redford（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260316/1110162744729931776137849.jpeg/MjnNdroxpAHd0Zp7Yf51OXLVah_YUs_UGyxPEhssTxI\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊Barbra Streisand（電影《俏郎君The Way We Were》劇照）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200616/349520040376274944.jpeg/pJ7hdCEo_nwccrR35Agce5n06jqyrFTiYg_lzmIP5c4\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（唱片封面）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（唱片封面）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200616/349520044386029568.jpeg/loKMDEfIeKerB1o4rdUOQh2QFzSAtqbTI6obsCOqG7A\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（唱片封面）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（唱片封面）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/2322628/org/b81bd7f6b68beb13cd2fb64d4d4176a8.jpg/Fi2PfWJ-rZAqt0pryQegqyzS4d4dqAN9RuNLXUbjS10\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊與愛犬Samantha合照。她現時飼養的其中兩隻狗便是從Samantha複製而來。（Getty Images）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊與愛犬Samantha合照。她現時飼養的其中兩隻狗便是從Samantha複製而來。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/194348/org/e81e9e3c9f3a2ef955b0d616d3d3b228.jpg/hOyoEwIZT5dYjoIIyKCYE31yrfIsQBWxl4zK05eMytM\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊致電庫克，投訴Siri讀錯她的姓氏。\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊致電庫克，投訴Siri讀錯她的姓氏。</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200616/349520042557313024.jpeg/xIlkWlLtmy9dhGSRsw1ceq9sB3xYiTtieYslNnmLJTY\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（唱片封面）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（唱片封面）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200616/349520048274149376.jpeg/7nE4TasafbElMU5_M481xR7Fl8BGWa9497Gc-_exnPs\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（IG@barbrastreisand）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（IG@barbrastreisand）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200616/349520046361546752.jpeg/jIgPwMD8zHuNSFWhSZ3MX54TYKOawxgDUfWCelH1gno\" alt=\"芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（IG@barbrastreisand）\"><figcaption>芭芭拉史翠珊（Barbra Streisand）是舉世知名的美國天后。（IG@barbrastreisand）</figcaption></figure><p>她也提到，原本十分期待與許多敬佩的電影工作者相聚，「當然，也很期待重返我一直深愛的法國。」雖然無法親自到場，她仍向今年入選影展的全球電影人獻上祝賀，並感謝康城影展長年支持電影藝術。</p><p>儘管史翠珊無法出席，康城影展仍將於5月23日閉幕典禮中特別向她致敬。影展官方也公開祝福她早日康復。</p><p>今年康城影展共有3位影人獲頒榮譽金棕櫚獎，除了史翠珊外，還包括「魔戒」導演彼得積遜（Peter Jackson），以及帶著導演處女作《Propeller One-Way Night Coach》參展的尊特拉華達John Travolta。其中，尊·特拉華達在作品放映前驚喜獲獎，當場激動落淚。他哽咽表示：「這甚至超越奧斯卡，我真的不敢相信，完全沒預料到會發生這件事。」</p><p>延伸閱讀：康城影展｜李冰冰隔10年再戰康城　水墨高訂現東方美學獲外媒盛讚</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260517/1132623604773556224723904.jpeg/GwrhhXLxKFa2Qjx2msdNSapQ80kKV0sLhig724YoO9s\" alt=\"【延伸閱讀：康城影展｜李冰冰隔10年再戰康城　水墨高訂現東方美學獲外媒盛讚】李冰冰身穿Armani Privé高訂禮服出席盛會。（gettyimages）\"><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：康城影展｜李冰冰隔10年再戰康城　水墨高訂現東方美學獲外媒盛讚】李冰冰身穿Armani Privé高訂禮服出席盛會。（gettyimages）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133063868998750208082173.jpeg/0n_4vcKMTwJjFmc5DIcaKGGGHxfu56yDyFls1shZbNY\" alt=\"李冰冰身穿Armani Privé高訂禮服出席盛會。（gettyimages）\"><figcaption>李冰冰身穿Armani Privé高訂禮服出席盛會。（gettyimages）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133063873004441600290673.png/lwHHz-vlpPzC_74ziEN4Fr7hM7YyubcauDZV6Lg2Veg\" alt=\"李冰冰身穿Armani Privé高訂禮服出席盛會。（gettyimages）\"><figcaption>李冰冰身穿Armani Privé高訂禮服出席盛會。（gettyimages）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260518/1133063875982528512071356.jpeg/nvwDPIaI1QbqVYBdHLOrOoF4srRHHT23KwQcFysEHBc\" alt=\"李冰冰身穿Armani Privé高訂禮服出席盛會。（gettyimages）\"><figcaption>李冰冰身穿Armani Privé高訂禮服出席盛會。（gettyimages）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782469034184704823104.png/ZrXNJcEmEdLXvWraOsCE0jqdM1st5CQB1FrZT9Ra2U8\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782469281648640487503.png/rLVrOY1cQZqkY_YZxI-KQ1MD9zAPxmgad_U37nf1N-4\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782469424254976561834.png/w6NqEbK4PL6NFPR41Nmn073hTkgIiLuT_MhQvPzIULw\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782469805936640702534.png/Z7_uGGjQnwbchSv11IRcmW0LxWHJEKtbPQhl7j0IZe4\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782465313574912802549.png/VdxiIKyQz8GCllkiISj1uoDeQ2It_To78wEDjvMBA44\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782465506512896807231.png/qt1UTgmdh8Y4qJ8GZKAo0gJxurbAxG7p1c2TGNXNkxg\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782465556844544631725.png/nmT80BJ6FtRoup91XtAQCmyhHXoegj7KuVhXSLlYV0g\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782465980469248574681.png/UOCHl2vbYoOMEacdjsyKhFIhBmCTqwrbmV1zJZldcyU\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782466995621888942168.png/8NzZkGaU84oqCW70RFd5Ah1pEDhNZI4RQSSwdkEksHY\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782467322777600078346.png/mkE0-bS4hLK2zlDivvEPPvmKYgi2KI9a11OzJ9dTsyc\" alt=\"李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）\"><figcaption>李冰冰（微博@李冰冰）</figcaption></figure><figure><img src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20250205/963782467524104192938056.png/P0V3six